==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|aland}}, {{m|enm|alond}}, {{m|enm|alonde}}, {{m|enm|o lande}}, from {{der|en|ang|on lande|t=on land}}, equivalent to {{af|en|a-|land}}.

