#* {{quote-book|en|year=c. 1541|title=The Chronicle of Calais|location=London|year_published=1846
|passage=Henry the Eighth {{...}} departed out of England from Sowthampton, with a great navy of shipps to set that company '''aland''' in Spayne, for to helpe the kynge of Spayne agaynste the Frenche kynge {{...}}}}

