##* {{RQ:Shakespeare Richard 3 Q1|act=V|scene=vi|page=100
|passage=And vvho doth lead them but a paltrey '''fellovv''',? / Long kept in Brittaine at our mothers coſt, / A milkeſopt, one that neuer in his life / Felt ſo much colde as ouer ſhooes in ſnovv: {{...}}}}
